# Fortified Village: "As this land enters, you may reveal a Forest or Plains card from your hand. If you don't, this land
# enters tapped. {T}: Add {G} or {W}" (CR 614.1d, 701.20a, 605.1a). Bot1 reveals a Forest, so it enters untapped; on turns 3
# and 5 it taps for {G} and for {W}, each the single mana the {T} buys, and it offers no blue.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fortified Village
Forest
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Fortified Village.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
? Bot1.Revealed = Forest
? Bot2.Revealed = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fortified Village.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fortified Village.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Fortified Village.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Fortified Village.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Fortified Village.Tapped = true
